'Example 03 - Beam bending check, single key variable and key objective
'Only the design lever and the final result carry the gh_/ghc_ prefix;
'everything else stays as a plain supporting variable. Intended for the
'FULL workflow with explicit Filter Names (one name each side), or with
'the Filter Names left empty since there is exactly one of each prefix.

q = 40N/mm'uniform load on the beam (=40 kN/m)
L = 5000mm'span
b = 150mm'beam width (fixed, not a design variable)
fy = 235MPa'steel yield strength (S235)

gh_h = 200mm'KEY design variable: beam height, driven from Grasshopper

M = q*L^2/8'maximum bending moment
W = b*gh_h^2/6'elastic section modulus
sigma = M/W'bending stress

ghc_util = sigma/fy'KEY objective: utilization ratio - should stay <= 1
